WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.561
is weird," Zann thought.

2
00:00:18.581 --> 00:00:22.003
"How can this woman not know about the Niffian towns we've seen?"

3
00:00:22.023 --> 00:00:27.406
"We're sorry to have bothered you," Perda said, her voice shaking slightly.

4
00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:28.847
"Come on, you guys.

5
00:00:28.887 --> 00:00:29.387
Let's go."

6
00:00:30.107 --> 00:00:30.848
She rushed away.

7
00:00:31.824 --> 00:00:33.165
Zann and Zing followed.

8
00:00:33.185 --> 00:00:35.667
"Wait up," Yarb called.

9
00:00:35.687 --> 00:00:37.948
"Don't leave me in this smelly place!"

10
00:00:38.809 --> 00:00:40.971
When they reached a meadow, Zann stopped.

11
00:00:40.991 --> 00:00:43.612
"Why don't we stay here for a little while and rest?"

12
00:00:44.993 --> 00:00:45.974
Perda shook her head.

13
00:00:45.994 --> 00:00:47.015
"Not here.

14
00:00:47.635 --> 00:00:49.416
Not until we figure out what's going on."

15
00:00:50.477 --> 00:00:55.521
Zann barely had time to grab Zing before Perda zapped the whole group to the wormhole.

16
00:00:57.942 --> 00:00:59.924
Soon they were back in the vortex.

17
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.522
Zann wasn't sure why Perda looked so scared.

18
00:01:04.062 --> 00:01:06.043
But now he was starting to worry too.

19
00:01:06.743 --> 00:01:09.285
Nothing about the worlds they'd found made sense.

20
00:01:09.305 --> 00:01:13.267
"There's a wormhole," Perda said, reaching out to grab it.

21
00:01:14.448 --> 00:01:19.811
When Zann pulled himself up beside her, he saw a world with purple trees and green grass.

22
00:01:19.831 --> 00:01:21.972
"This is Wyssa's home world!"

23
00:01:22.272 --> 00:01:22.892
he exclaimed.

24
00:01:22.912 --> 00:01:24.333
"I'm sure of it!"

25
00:01:25.233 --> 00:01:26.374
They pulled themselves out.

26
00:01:26.394 --> 00:01:28.575
"Who's Wyssa?"

27
00:01:29.056 --> 00:01:29.636
Yarb asked.

28
00:01:30.344 --> 00:01:31.545
Zann barely heard him.

29
00:01:31.565 --> 00:01:36.348
"This world has very weak magic," he said, remembering their previous visit.

30
00:01:37.168 --> 00:01:37.889
Perda nodded.

31
00:01:37.909 --> 00:01:42.511
"It should be enough for us to create food and refresh our energy though.

32
00:01:42.531 --> 00:01:44.232
Let's look for people."

33
00:01:45.473 --> 00:01:49.676
On their previous visit, Wyssa had purposely landed in a deserted area.

34
00:01:50.536 --> 00:01:53.558
She had been shunned by her people and didn't want to see them.

35
00:01:54.318 --> 00:01:56.920
She hadn't even told the kids the name of this world.

36
00:02:00.084 --> 00:02:05.107
"Wyssa is so powerful," Zann said as they walked, with Zing flying overhead.

37
00:02:05.127 --> 00:02:07.568
"Maybe someone here knows how to contact her.

38
00:02:08.268 --> 00:02:12.251
We could ask her to take Yarb home, check on Mellis, and point us toward Magica."

39
00:02:12.911 --> 00:02:14.472
They reached a small settlement.

40
00:02:15.192 --> 00:02:17.073
Several people emerged to greet them.

41
00:02:17.093 --> 00:02:21.015
"Welcome!" an older man said.

42
00:02:21.035 --> 00:02:23.497
"Are you visitors to Roxo?"

43
00:02:23.517 --> 00:02:25.718
"Is that the name of this world?"

44
00:02:26.018 --> 00:02:26.638
Perda asked.

45
00:02:26.658 --> 00:02:28.319
"Thanks for the welcome.

46
00:02:28.879 --> 00:02:29.820
We're from Magica."

47
00:02:30.812 --> 00:02:33.574
"Magica?" The man furrowed his brow.

48
00:02:33.594 --> 00:02:36.495
"Is that a settlement in Niffia?"

49
00:02:37.316 --> 00:02:38.076
A woman laughed.

50
00:02:38.096 --> 00:02:42.258
"Of course not," she said.

51
00:02:42.278 --> 00:02:43.939
"They have noses!

52
00:02:44.239 --> 00:02:46.941
They must be from Illumos or perhaps Skellia."

53
00:02:46.961 --> 00:02:49.682
"No, we're from Magica."

54
00:02:50.303 --> 00:02:53.484
Zann was surprised that nobody seemed to recognize the name.

55
00:02:53.504 --> 00:02:56.146
"Well, except for Yarb," he added.

56
00:02:56.166 --> 00:02:57.827
"He's from Terrica."

57
00:02:57.847 --> 00:03:00.308
"Terrica," the man said.

58
00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:04.522
"Isn't that the world you discovered a few years ago, Tassa?"

59
00:03:05.242 --> 00:03:06.702
A young woman stepped forward.

60
00:03:07.823 --> 00:03:08.523
Zann blinked.

61
00:03:08.543 --> 00:03:13.065
"Wow, you look like a younger, taller, friendlier version of Wyssa!"

62
00:03:13.645 --> 00:03:15.386
He immediately regretted saying that.

63
00:03:16.026 --> 00:03:17.847
What if these people were still mad at her?

64
00:03:19.348 --> 00:03:20.748
But Tassa didn't look mad.

65
00:03:21.348 --> 00:03:22.449
She looked confused.

66
00:03:23.109 --> 00:03:23.929
"Who's Wyssa?

67
00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:25.730
Is she a friend of yours?"

68
00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.051
"Sort of," Perda said.

69
00:03:28.071 --> 00:03:30.092
"She helped us a few times.

70
00:03:30.712 --> 00:03:32.533
We think she was born in this world."

71
00:03:33.174 --> 00:03:34.614
The Roxons traded looks.

72
00:03:35.575 --> 00:03:36.716
The older man shrugged.

73
00:03:36.736 --> 00:03:39.517
"I don't know anybody with that name."

74
00:03:40.498 --> 00:03:41.539
Zann was surprised.

75
00:03:42.139 --> 00:03:46.021
He was certain that this was Wyssa's home world and that she was well-known.

76
00:03:46.041 --> 00:03:48.983
"You've been to Terrica?"

77
00:03:49.543 --> 00:03:51.224
Yarb asked Tassa eagerly.

78
00:03:51.244 --> 00:03:53.366
"Yes," Tassa replied.

79
00:03:53.386 --> 00:03:56.928
"But only a couple of times, since it doesn't have magic.

80
00:03:57.756 --> 00:04:00.938
I advised a woman I met there on some basic potions.

81
00:04:01.639 --> 00:04:04.441
I hope she was able to help her people by using them."

82
00:04:05.221 --> 00:04:06.442
"Was her name Zira?"

83
00:04:06.782 --> 00:04:07.423
Perda asked.

84
00:04:08.223 --> 00:04:09.004
Tassa nodded.

85
00:04:09.704 --> 00:04:10.505
Perda gasped.

86
00:04:11.866 --> 00:04:15.388
"That's why Zira believed we came from another world, Zann!

87
00:04:16.068 --> 00:04:18.210
She already knew other worlds existed!"

88
00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:21.072
"You're right," Zann said.

89
00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:27.723
"This also explains how she knew how to make that purple healing potion she used on your arm,"

90
00:04:28.224 --> 00:04:28.764
Perda said.

91
00:04:28.784 --> 00:04:34.927
"Yes, I left her a supply of oogberry seeds I picked up in Niffia," Tassa said.

92
00:04:34.947 --> 00:04:38.509
"The berries make any magic stronger."

93
00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.091
Perda smacked herself in the forehead.

94
00:04:41.111 --> 00:04:44.773
"I knew those berry bushes in her courtyard looked familiar!

95
00:04:45.293 --> 00:04:48.955
We saw Wyssa pick oogberries in Niffia, Zann, remember?"

96
00:04:50.175 --> 00:04:50.876
Zann nodded.

97
00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:56.802
"If those berries make magic stronger, it's no wonder Zira got so good at magic so fast."

98
00:04:57.563 --> 00:04:58.603
Perda looked grim.

99
00:04:58.623 --> 00:05:03.025
"I saw purple marks on some of her goons too," she said.

100
00:05:03.045 --> 00:05:07.807
"This explains why Zira has been letting Vilkor pretend to be leader.

101
00:05:08.547 --> 00:05:10.388
Those bushes are still growing.

102
00:05:11.088 --> 00:05:17.711
She's probably just waiting to gather enough oogberries to help her take total control over Terrica!"

103
00:05:18.511 --> 00:05:19.892
Yarb looked confused.

104
00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:21.761
"What are you talking about?

105
00:05:22.401 --> 00:05:23.722
Who's taking over Terrica?"

106
00:05:24.503 --> 00:05:27.825
"We'll explain in the vortex on the way back there," Perda said.

107
00:05:27.845 --> 00:05:30.727
"What?" Zann was surprised.

108
00:05:30.747 --> 00:05:33.149
"I thought we were going home to Magica!"

109
00:05:33.169 --> 00:05:38.973
"Now that we've guessed Zira's plan, we have to warn Mellis," Perda said.

110
00:05:38.993 --> 00:05:41.995
"Those berry bushes are growing fast.

111
00:05:42.495 --> 00:05:43.916
There's no time to waste!"

112
00:05:44.737 --> 00:05:49.400
Zann imagined how nice it would be to reunite with his parents, Boz, and Darb.

113
00:05:49.844 --> 00:05:54.627
It would be even nicer to hand over all the problems in Terrica to the adults and let

114
00:05:54.727 --> 00:05:56.008
them take care of everything.

115
00:05:56.989 --> 00:05:58.350
But he knew Perda was right.

116
00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.071
They had to help their friend.

117
00:06:00.631 --> 00:06:01.752
Perda looked at Yarb.

118
00:06:01.772 --> 00:06:04.494
"We'll take you back with us," she told him.

119
00:06:04.514 --> 00:06:07.756
"Unless you'd rather stay here where it's safe."

120
00:06:08.617 --> 00:06:12.379
"Yes, you are welcome to stay," the Roxon man said.

121
00:06:12.399 --> 00:06:15.762
"Thanks, but I want to go home," Yarb said.

122
00:06:15.782 --> 00:06:19.164
"If Terrica is in danger, I want to help save it."

123
00:06:20.216 --> 00:06:21.397
"Good," Perda said.

124
00:06:21.417 --> 00:06:23.819
"We'll tell you about friction on the way.

125
00:06:24.299 --> 00:06:27.242
Then you can share that knowledge with all your friends.

126
00:06:27.922 --> 00:06:32.005
The more people who know the truth, the less power Zira will have."

127
00:06:32.766 --> 00:06:35.829
Tassa and the other Roxons looked slightly confused.

128
00:06:36.249 --> 00:06:38.791
But Tassa agreed to guide them back to Terrica.

129
00:06:38.811 --> 00:06:43.314
"I'm the most skilled at navigating the vortex," she said.

130
00:06:43.995 --> 00:06:45.096
Zann peered at her.

131
00:06:45.116 --> 00:06:48.699
"Are you sure you aren't related to someone named Wyssa?"

132
00:06:49.259 --> 00:06:50.000
Tassa chuckled.

133
00:06:51.958 --> 00:06:53.220
"I'm sure.

134
00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.803
But I like the sound of your friend's name.

135
00:06:56.564 --> 00:06:57.926
Now let's get going."
